r":false,"text":"主人公の世話女房役である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家庭は汎用である。ごくごく平均的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツをこよなく愛する運動系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公はたまに涼香のことをじゃまだと思う節もあるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本心からじゃまだと思ったり目の上のたんこぶと考えるわけではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小うるさいけどしかたがないか、程度である。いわば小姑。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"細々と口うるさい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頼まれても居ないのに弁当を作ってきたりと世話焼くのが好き。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"109927"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7bc389e56373e233d2d77c9a2fbe9ca8bb8dbca8ecf71e217a378daf938864c6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/9359b076f658989cf1d6631ed60c8f9efb5cda72f7da5a182a2d38477c354025.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青山 ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:29369","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c40790","characterName":"檻都 美久","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"110398","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"113318"},{"characterId":"110398","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"113319"},{"characterId":"110398","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"113320"},{"characterId":"110398","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"113322"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22757"],"vndbCharacterId":"c40790"},"originalCharacterName":"檻都 美久","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Classmate to the protagonist. She is unhappy with the way she is treated due to her status as a rich young lady, she wishes to change that sentiment."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she is high class she does not give off that aura. She speaks what she wants to speak, however, conversations do not last long. She is the classic yamato nadeshiko who is attentive in the sense of taking care of men."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In terms of status, she is the heroine of the school and everyone looks up to her. She is frustrated by the fact that she is viewed as a heroine by others. She wishes to hang out with friends, but others around her say, \"she really doesn't do that kind of thing, does she?\". As a result she doesn't get invited to things."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She also secretly wears red toenail polish, which is prohibited by school rules. This is an expression of her true feelings of not wanting to remain a \"heroine\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40790"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスメイトのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女自身は、お嬢様扱いされたり、特別扱いされることに不満を感じているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分を、彼女は変えたいと思っているが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22757","sourceWorkId":"3799","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のクラスメイトのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女自身は、お嬢様扱いされたり、特別扱いされることに不満を感じているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分を、彼女は変えたいと思っているが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22757","sourceWorkId":"3872","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もっとも、自分がお嬢様として扱われることや、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特別扱いをされてしまうことに不満を感じているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分を変えていきたい、と思っているようだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22757","sourceWorkId":"4880","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトのお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もっとも、自分がお嬢様として扱われることや、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特別扱いをされてしまうことに不満を感じているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな自分を変えていきたい、と思っているようだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22757",