00,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"さくらなつみ","creatorId":"vndb:s666","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s666","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s666","name":"岩泉まい(樋口まゆら、樋口まゆ)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:113319:204319:6279:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c138070","characterName":"鈴木公志","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c138070"},"originalCharacterName":"鈴木公志","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist. He is childhood friend's with Suzuka. He's neither dumb or smart, he's average, generic, and bland. At worst, he can be indecisive and emotional."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is very interested in sex, especially because he's at that age. He's even interested in sex with people he doesn't particularly have any interest in, his desire is so strong he is ready for the act whenever wherever."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c138070"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c40791","characterName":"草薙 千聡","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c40791"},"originalCharacterName":"草薙 千聡","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A woman of few words. She is a sadist at heart with a lustful thought process. She has a rather dark personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She finds motivation in teasing the main character, however, she doesn't enjoy just sexual acts. Sexual acts are just a part of teasing for her, and her interest in actual sexual intercourse is very low."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a queen by profession, she teaches and does sex work as a part time job. She doesn't have the mindset of making others feel good for the sake of it. Her sexual satisfaction comes from different motives, by subduing and humiliating others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She becomes incredibly interested and attached to the main protagonist. She also wishes to bring Suzuka into her world."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40791"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94228a25bf109788f4e51a04c031e9c9707b294240833f674df8cd3271b0a98a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/543c5dd7d1f86b7dcc2f4cc1d85c3c914a2953e7ad1fe00e7b32ce77e5ca7740.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北都 南","creatorId":"vndb:s113","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s113","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s113","name":"ひと美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:29368","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c40792","characterName":"笹宮 太一","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c40792"},"originalCharacterName":"笹宮 太一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ea/eab589d9d82dfe1368b41afee942b6f4c8ec94d7f25ba4c5f60c7da3e66c85b6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/617102ed820a9b1d1ecf5a9de9bdaf3715d120741a0b9ddeffd9fa57b2bb3609.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"日向 日影",